WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,700
Take a look at the gift from Youyou

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:06,170
I watched it when the housekeeper was helping Youyou with the dishes

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:08,770
A person that big must be a hundred years old, right?

4
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:10,530
I have the appearance of giving gifts for two hundred years.

5
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,170
The higher the appearance, the better the effect

6
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:13,490
The healing properties of this strain as a gift

7
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:16,050
It's comparable to a century-old old man

8
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,730
Please open Miss Yoyo's gift and take a look.

9
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:21,650
Is it time to open the gifts now, sir?

10
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:24,330
Why are you becoming more and more out of tune lately?

11
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:28,310
A birthday gift from Miss Youyou

12
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,270
It's a century-old human body

13
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:31,630
Old minister, old minister

14
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:33,590
The Pei family has treated you badly for so many years

15
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:36,390
I didn’t expect you to braid this little girl’s hair to please us.

16
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,030
I can tell any lie

17
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,230
A hundred years of life

18
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,950
There is another child from the country

19
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:42,590
It would be nice to give her a carrot.

20
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:43,910
it was your idea

21
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:45,230
It was still Yoyo’s idea

22
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,560
Have Mr. Pei and Mrs. Pei lost their quality? 
